[PrintTextModified Text:为、为什么？梅露露不是<br>帮助过玛格吗！|#0201Adv26_Ema001| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

; @char Ema.Pensive1

[PrintTextModified Text:她一直照顾重伤的玛格，<br>那么关心你，那么尽心尽力……|#0201Adv26_Ema002| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@AnimateActorExtended ActorIds:MainBackground-Front,Ema-Front Loop:false
@HideActors ActorIds:Ema-Front Lazy:false
@DestroySpawnedExtended Path:MaskingRectangle SubId:Front LogWarning:true

