[PrintTextModified Text:呵呵，就是这样。<br>我啊，就是因为深爱着她才杀了她的。|#0201Adv26_Margo008| AuthorId:Margo RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Margo.Smile1 SubId:Middle

[PrintTextModified Text:你们迟早也会明白的。<br>对爱最终极的回应，就是死亡呀。|#0201Adv26_Margo009| AuthorId:Margo RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:玛格带着陶醉的表情说出这些话，<br>我对她只感到厌恶。|#0201Adv26_Narrative006| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

