[PrintTextModified Text:舞台被灯光照亮，<br>上有一个巨大的靶子。|#0201Adv26_Narrative010| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:少女们预感到一场恶趣味的表演即将在眼前展开，<br>不禁吞了一口口水。|#0201Adv26_Narrative011| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:……是要搞什么马戏表演？|#0201Adv26_Alisa001| AuthorId:Alisa RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:难道是扔飞刀……？|#0201Adv26_Sherry001| AuthorId:Sherry RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:……相当华丽的处刑台呢。|#0201Adv26_Leia001| AuthorId:Leia RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:她到底在想什么呢。|#0201Adv26_Narrative012| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:玛格正在被押送到木制靶子的面前。<br>从她的表情读不出任何感情。|#0201Adv26_Narrative013| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:在我们屏息注视下——|#0201Adv26_Narrative014| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyBackgroundExtended Duration:0 Lazy:false AppearanceAndTransition:SolidColor SubId:Overlay
@HideActors ActorIds:Stills-Front,Stills-Middle,Stills Lazy:false
@ModifyBackgroundExtended Id:Stills Rotation:,,0 Scale:{g_backgroundDefaultScale} Lazy:false ScenePosition:50,50 AppearanceAndTransition:440_1
@ModifyBackgroundExtended Duration:0.9 Lazy:false AppearanceAndTransition:Transparent SubId:Overlay
@Wait WaitMode:1

[PrintTextModified Text:玛格双手双脚被用皮带固定住，<br>身体无法动弹。|#0201Adv26_Narrative015| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:也就是被束缚在靶子上的状态。<br>|#0201Adv26_Narrative016| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:哎呀呀♡品味这么低俗，真是太棒啦♡<br>让人兴奋不已呢♡|#0201Adv26_Margo011| AuthorId:Margo RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:即使犯下杀人罪，即使被束缚——<br>她依然保持着妖艳的微笑。|#0201Adv26_Narrative017| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:"（正常的飞刀表演，<br>　是不会刺中目标的）|#0201Adv26_Hiro006|" AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:"（但既然是处刑，<br>　那么刀子一定会……）|#0201Adv26_Hiro007|" AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:也许是因为恐怖的预感，<br>许多少女忍不住捂住眼睛或转过头去。|#0201Adv26_Narrative018| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

; ナイフが飛んでくる音
@PlaySfxModified SfxPath:Sfx_122 Volume:1 Loop:false FadeInDuration:0

[PrintTextModified Text:划破空气的声音响起的同时，<br>不知从哪里飞来了凶器。|#0201Adv26_Narrative019| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:锐利的尖端闪着寒光。|#0201Adv26_Narrative020| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

; ナイフが板に刺さる音
@PlaySfxModified SfxPath:Sfx_123 Volume:1 Loop:false FadeInDuration:0

@ModifyBackgroundExtended Id:Stills Rotation:,,-45 Scale:3 Lazy:false ScenePosition:75,-40 AppearanceAndTransition:440_2 SubId:Middle

; ＠備考◆恐怖に息を呑む

[PrintTextModified Text:……|#0201Adv26_Margo012| AuthorId:Margo RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:插在靶子上的<br>不是飞刀——而是形状恶俗的箭矢。|#0201Adv26_Narrative021| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:箭矢深深地刺入了距离玛格脸颊<br>仅几厘米的地方。|#0201Adv26_Narrative022| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:从射出箭矢的速度来看，<br>如果射中了的话，一定已经贯穿了她的脸颊。|#0201Adv26_Narrative023| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

; ナイフが飛んでくる音・連続
@PlaySfxModified SfxPath:Sfx_122 Volume:1 Loop:false FadeInDuration:0

; ナイフが板に刺さる音・連続
@PlaySfxModified SfxPath:Sfx_123 Volume:1 Loop:false FadeInDuration:0

@ModifyBackgroundExtended Id:Stills Rotation:,,-45 Scale:3 Lazy:false ScenePosition:75,-40 AppearanceAndTransition:440_3 SubId:Middle

[PrintTextModified Text:接着又飞来许多箭矢，<br>它们同样没有射中玛格，而是插在几乎就要射中的边沿。|#0201Adv26_Narrative024| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:也许是因为凶器没有刺中自己，反而造成了更大的心理压迫，<br>刚才还在妖艳微笑的玛格，表情已经开始绷紧了。|#0201Adv26_Narrative025| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:……梅露露，<br>真的是个善良的好孩子。|#0201Adv26_Margo013| AuthorId:Margo RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:在无数箭矢射中标靶的间隙中，<br>玛格低声呢喃着。|#0201Adv26_Narrative026| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:简直难以相信她是魔女，<br>她那么可爱，那么惹人怜爱……|#0201Adv26_Margo014| AuthorId:Margo RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:我想把她的一切都占为己有。<br>那惊讶地看着我的眼神、<br>那圣洁的服装、那可爱的声音。|#0201Adv26_Margo015| AuthorId:Margo RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:那美丽的银发、<br>那飞溅的鲜血，还有心脏，全部、全部全部。|#0201Adv26_Margo016| AuthorId:Margo RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyBackgroundExtended Id:Stills Rotation:,,-45 Scale:3 Lazy:false ScenePosition:75,-40 AppearanceAndTransition:440_4 SubId:Middle

[PrintTextModified Text:真的太爱太爱了，<br>就把她变成了我的东西……！|#0201Adv26_Margo017| AuthorId:Margo RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:僵硬的笑容扭曲至极。|#0201Adv26_Narrative027| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:够了，不想再听了……！|#0201Adv26_Ema003| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:我用余光扫过泪流满面地摇头的艾玛，<br>直视玛格。|#0201Adv26_Narrative028| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:你在说谎。|#0201Adv26_Hiro008| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:我再也无法保持沉默，脱口而出，<br>随后玛格看向了我。|#0201Adv26_Narrative029| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@StopBgm
@ModifyBackgroundExtended Id:Stills Rotation:,,-45 Scale:3 Lazy:false ScenePosition:75,-40 AppearanceAndTransition:440_5 SubId:Middle

[PrintTextModified Text:很遗憾，这不是谎言。<br>这就是我真实的爱——|#0201Adv26_Margo018| AuthorId:Margo RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@PlayBgm BgmPath:Bgm_43_2 Volume:1 Loop:true FadeInDuration:0

[PrintTextModified Text:你在说谎！！|#0201Adv26_Hiro009| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyBackgroundExtended Id:Stills Rotation:,,0 Scale:{g_backgroundDefaultScale} Lazy:false ScenePosition:50,50 AppearanceAndTransition:440_5 SubId:Front

[PrintTextModified Text:我再次斩钉截铁地说道。<br>玛格的眼神第一次动摇了。|#0201Adv26_Narrative030| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:你根本就不爱梅露露！！|#0201Adv26_Hiro010| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:这就是真实的爱？令人作呕。<br>你的爱是【谎言】！！|#0201Adv26_Hiro011| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:我的脑海中浮现出她的身影。|#0201Adv26_Narrative031| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:失去她的痛苦<br>无论经过多么漫长的时间也不会消失。|#0201Adv26_Narrative032| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:杀戮怎么可能是爱。|#0201Adv26_Narrative033| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:我只想一直、永远——<br>和她在一起。|#0201Adv26_Narrative034| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:那根本不是爱！！<br>你根本不懂什么是爱！！|#0201Adv26_Hiro012| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyBackgroundExtended Id:Stills Rotation:,,-45 Scale:3 Lazy:false ScenePosition:75,-40 AppearanceAndTransition:440_6 SubId:Middle
@HideActors ActorIds:Stills-Front Lazy:false

[PrintTextModified Text:我发自内心的呐喊，<br>让玛格的表情大为扭曲。|#0201Adv26_Narrative035| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:不是的，不是……<br>我懂得爱，<br>这就是爱啊……|#0201Adv26_Margo019| AuthorId:Margo RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:嗯——我虽然也不太了解什么是爱，<br>但我更认同希罗的主张！|#0201Adv26_Sherry002| AuthorId:Sherry RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:玛格，<br>你不是因为爱才杀人，<br>而是因为想让她消失才杀人的，对吧。|#0201Adv26_Sherry003| AuthorId:Sherry RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

; ＠備考◆息を呑む

[PrintTextModified Text:——！|#0201Adv26_Margo020| AuthorId:Margo RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:就是啊。<br>承认自己讨厌她不是会轻松点吗？|#0201Adv26_Coco002| AuthorId:Coco RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyBackgroundExtended Id:Stills Rotation:,,-45 Scale:3 Lazy:false ScenePosition:75,-40 AppearanceAndTransition:440_7 SubId:Middle

; ＠備考◆余裕失って

[PrintTextModified Text:不对！<br>不对不对不对不对！！|#0201Adv26_Margo021| AuthorId:Margo RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:我懂得爱！！<br>这就是爱！！|#0201Adv26_Margo022| AuthorId:Margo RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:够了！！<br>不要否定我的爱！！|#0201Adv26_Margo023| AuthorId:Margo RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyBackgroundExtended Id:Stills Rotation:,,0 Scale:{g_backgroundDefaultScale} Lazy:false ScenePosition:50,50 AppearanceAndTransition:440_7 SubId:Front

[PrintTextModified Text:【不要爱我】——！|#0201Adv26_Margo024| AuthorId:Margo RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:尖叫过后，<br>玛格自己也惊讶地绷紧了表情。|#0201Adv26_Narrative036| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyBackgroundExtended Id:Stills Rotation:,,-45 Scale:3 Lazy:false ScenePosition:75,-40 AppearanceAndTransition:440_8 SubId:Middle
@HideActors ActorIds:Stills-Front Lazy:false

[PrintTextModified Text:我、我刚才、说了什么……|#0201Adv26_Margo025| AuthorId:Margo RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:大概就在那时。<br>终于吐露出真心的双唇开始颤抖。|#0201Adv26_Narrative037| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:玛格被束缚着的身体，<br>开始发生变化。|#0201Adv26_Narrative038| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:脸上出现裂纹，<br>指甲肉眼可见地伸长。|#0201Adv26_Narrative039| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

; ナイフが飛んでくる音・連続
@PlaySfxModified SfxPath:Sfx_122 Volume:1 Loop:false FadeInDuration:0

[PrintTextModified Text:靶子上<br>已经密密麻麻地插满了箭矢，<br>几乎不见一丝间隙。|#0201Adv26_Narrative040| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyBackgroundExtended Id:Stills Rotation:,,0 Scale:{g_backgroundDefaultScale} Lazy:false ScenePosition:50,50 AppearanceAndTransition:440_9 SubId:Front

[PrintTextModified Text:终于，大量的箭矢如雨点般，<br>朝着玛格全身飞去。|#0201Adv26_Narrative041| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:啊——原来我，|#0201Adv26_Margo026| AuthorId:Margo RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@StopBgm
@ModifyBackgroundExtended Id:Stills Rotation:,,0 Scale:{g_backgroundDefaultScale} Lazy:false ScenePosition:50,50 AppearanceAndTransition:440_10 SubId:Front


[PrintTextModified Text:不懂什么是爱啊。|#0201Adv26_Margo027| AuthorId:Margo RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyBackgroundExtended Id:Stills Rotation:,,-45 Scale:3 Lazy:false ScenePosition:75,-40 AppearanceAndTransition:440_11 SubId:Middle
@HideActors ActorIds:Stills-Front Lazy:false

[PrintTextModified Text:轻声吐露出的寂寞话语，<br>打开了玛格<br>封锁在内心的【禁忌】之门——|#0201Adv26_Narrative042| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

