; トラウマシーン
; ========================================

@ResetText
@ModifyBackgroundExtended Duration:0.9 Lazy:false AppearanceAndTransition:SolidColor SubId:Overlay
@Wait WaitMode:1.2
@HideActors ActorIds:Stills-Middle Lazy:false

@PlayBgm BgmPath:Bgm_1_1 Volume:1 Loop:true FadeInDuration:0

@ModifyTextPrinter Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Normal.Simple MakeDefault:true HideOther:true

[PrintTextModified Text:——一边听着“我爱你”，一边挨打。|#0201Adv26_Narrative043| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:这样的日子，是从什么时候开始的呢？<br>早就算不清了，也不想再算了。|#0201Adv26_Narrative044| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyBackgroundExtended Id:Stills Rotation:,,0 Scale:3 Duration:0 Lazy:false ScenePosition:-20,120 AppearanceAndTransition:230_1
@WaitForNextFrame

@AnimateActorExtended ActorIds:Stills Loop:false ScenePositionY:0 Scale:2.8 EasingTypeName:Linear Duration:12

@ModifyBackgroundExtended TintColor:#000000 Duration:0.9 Lazy:false AppearanceAndTransition:Transparent SubId:Overlay
@Wait WaitMode:0.9

[PrintTextModified Text:在充满腐臭、堆满垃圾的房间里。|#0201Adv26_Narrative045| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:和垃圾一同被扔在房间的玛格，<br>不知从何时起，已经放弃了思考。|#0201Adv26_Narrative046| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:母亲本就不是个像样的人。<br>偶尔回家看一眼玛格的情况，<br>留下食物和一点钱后便匆匆离开。|#0201Adv26_Narrative047| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:某天，母亲带了一个男人回家。<br>母亲说，她也【爱】那个男人。|#0201Adv26_Narrative048| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:在四张半榻榻米大的狭窄房间门后，<br>母亲每天都对那个男人说【我爱你】。|#0201Adv26_Narrative049| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:取而代之的，<br>是她不再对玛格说【我爱你】了。|#0201Adv26_Narrative050| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:男人回应了母亲的爱。|#0201Adv26_Narrative051| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:回应是不断堆积的垃圾。<br>是充斥耳膜的怒吼。<br>是对母亲施暴。|#0201Adv26_Narrative052| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:终于有一天，<br>那男人来到玛格藏身的小房间，拉开隔扇。|#0201Adv26_Narrative053| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyBackgroundExtended Id:Stills Rotation:,,0 Scale:3 Duration:0.8 Lazy:false ScenePosition:50,120 AppearanceAndTransition:230_1 SubId:Front
@Wait WaitMode:0.5
@AnimateActorExtended ActorIds:Stills-Front Loop:false ScenePositionY:20 Scale:2 EasingTypeName:Linear Duration:15

[PrintTextModified Text:他对玛格施暴了。|#0201Adv26_Narrative054| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:被打、被骂、被踩。|#0201Adv26_Narrative055| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:被揍、被辱骂、<br>被揪住头发、被扔东西到身上。|#0201Adv26_Narrative056| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:被打、被打、被打。<br>被揍、被揍、被揍。<br>被伤害、被伤害、被伤害。|#0201Adv26_Narrative057| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:某天，满身瘀青的玛格，<br>在断断续续的意识中，注意到了母亲的目光。<br>母亲只是冷冷地俯视着她。|#0201Adv26_Narrative058| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:玛格用目光请求着，救救我。<br>可母亲表情中流露出的却是——|#0201Adv26_Narrative059| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyBackgroundExtended Id:Stills Rotation:,,0 Scale:{g_backgroundDefaultScale} Duration:0 Lazy:false ScenePosition:50,50 AppearanceAndTransition:230_1
@HideActors ActorIds:Stills-Middle,Stills-Front Lazy:false

[PrintTextModified Text:轻蔑。|#0201Adv26_Narrative060| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:聪明的玛格明白了。<br>因为我夺走了那男人的爱。|#0201Adv26_Narrative061| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:母亲恨我。|#0201Adv26_Narrative062| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:我得到了爱，所以她嫉妒。<br>我年轻，我美丽，我得到了注视。|#0201Adv26_Narrative063| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:玛格流着泪，<br>领悟了爱的模样。|#0201Adv26_Narrative064| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@StopBgm

[PrintTextModified Text:但是……|#0201Adv26_Narrative065| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ResetText
@ModifyBackgroundExtended Duration:0.9 Lazy:false AppearanceAndTransition:SolidColor SubId:Overlay
@Wait WaitMode:1.2
@HideActors ActorIds:Stills Lazy:false

[PrintTextModified Text:母亲离开了，男人也离开了，<br>只留下玛格独自一人，在被褥上。<br>玛格用轻得几乎听不见的声音，喃喃着。|#0201Adv26_Narrative066| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:……明明……<br>我真的、真的，很讨厌这一切啊。|#0201Adv26_Narrative067| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

