[PrintTextModified Text:玛格的身体<br>被无数箭矢刺穿。|#0201Adv26_Narrative068| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

; ＠備考◆吐き気

[PrintTextModified Text:呃……|#0201Adv26_AnAn001| AuthorId:AnAn RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

; ＠備考◆拒絶

[PrintTextModified Text:呜呜！|#0201Adv26_Hanna001| AuthorId:Hanna RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:数不清的箭矢一根一根刺入玛格体内，<br>她如野兽般低吼、痛苦挣扎——|#0201Adv26_Narrative069| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:咆哮着，化作了异形。|#0201Adv26_Narrative070| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:由于她已顺利变成魔女的残骸，<br>接下来她会被关进永恒的囚牢之中。|#0201Adv26_Warden005| AuthorId:Warden RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:典狱长平静地说道。<br>紧接着是一阵机械运转声。|#0201Adv26_Narrative071| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyBackgroundExtended Rotation:,,0 Scale:{g_backgroundDefaultScale} Lazy:false ScenePosition:50,50 AppearanceAndTransition:13_1 SubId:Middle
@HideActors ActorIds:Stills-Middle Lazy:false

; 歯車がまわる音
@PlaySfxModified SfxPath:Sfx_36 Volume:1 Loop:false FadeInDuration:0

[PrintTextModified Text:这时机关开始运作，<br>将处刑台降至地下，移出了现场。|#0201Adv26_Narrative072| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:异形的咆哮声仍持续回荡了一阵子，<br>直到地板关闭，一切恢复沉寂。|#0201Adv26_Narrative073| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:中央恢复成了原来的底座，<br>只有如同残香般的——<br>一只赤红的蝴蝶在轻盈飞舞。|#0201Adv26_Narrative074| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:（这就是……魔女的处刑……）|#0201Adv26_Hiro013| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:亲眼目睹了如此惨烈的处刑，<br>我们失去了言语。|#0201Adv26_Narrative075| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:目睹了如此可怕又悲伤的场面，<br>想必艾玛一定在哭泣吧，<br>我不由自主地看向她。|#0201Adv26_Narrative076| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HidePrinter
@ModifyBackgroundExtended Scale:{g_backgroundDefaultScale} TintColor:#000000 Duration:0 Lazy:false ScenePosition:50,50 AppearanceAndTransition:13_1 SubId:Middle
@ModifyCharacterExtended Rotation:,,0 Scale:3 Duration:0 Lazy:false ScenePosition:70,61 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Normal1,ArmR3 SubId:Middle
@Wait WaitMode:0.9

[PrintTextModified Text:但映入我眼帘的艾玛，竟然——<br>……在笑。|#0201Adv26_Narrative077| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:（艾玛……你果然……）|#0201Adv26_Hiro014| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:我无言地握紧了颤抖的拳头。|#0201Adv26_Narrative078| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ResetText
@HideActors ActorIds:Ema-Middle Duration:0 Lazy:false
@ModifyBackgroundExtended Scale:{g_backgroundDefaultScale} TintColor:#FFFFFF Lazy:false ScenePosition:50,50 AppearanceAndTransition:13_1 SubId:Middle
@Wait WaitMode:0.9

[PrintTextModified Text:审判庭陷入死寂。<br>一时间，没有任何人说话。|#0201Adv26_Narrative079| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:打破这令人窒息的沉默的<br>是典狱长。|#0201Adv26_Narrative080| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Warden.1 SubId:Front

[PrintTextModified Text:能顺利结束真是太好了呢。<br>如果之后再发生凶杀案的话，<br>就会开展魔女审判。|#0201Adv26_Warden006| AuthorId:Warden RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:在下次审判到来之前，请大家跟往常一样，<br>老实规矩地作为囚犯生活下去吧。|#0201Adv26_Warden007| AuthorId:Warden RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:魔女审判，就此闭庭。<br>哎呀呀，真是辛苦大家了……|#0201Adv26_Warden008| AuthorId:Warden RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

[PrintTextModified Text:在我们心中留下无法抹去的深深伤痕后——<br>审判结束了。|#0201Adv26_Narrative081| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

